2. Model data (CC BY-SA 4.0, excluded from the above)
   The 3D meshes in docs/packs/ and meshes/ are derived from Z-Anatomy
   (https://github.com/Z-Anatomy/Models-of-human-anatomy), itself derived from
   BodyParts3D (The Database Center for Life Science, CC BY-SA 2.1 JP) with
   cranial nerves from the University of Dundee CAHID (CC BY 4.0). They were
   decimated, recolored and repacked for this viewer and are shared under the
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Attribution to the
   sources above must be kept when the model data is reused.

